[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12720.95, "timestamp": "03:32:00", "text": "你不停地向左转，向右转，再向左转。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12722.469, "timestamp": "03:32:02", "text": "右边，中间，就像你一直转圈一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12744.15, "timestamp": "03:32:24", "text": "这些飞机就是这样运作的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12753.03, "timestamp": "03:32:33", "text": "以你的战斗等级来看，这介于你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12756.63, "timestamp": "03:32:36", "text": "起飞区域以及距离中心有多远"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12759.67, "timestamp": "03:32:39", "text": "地图是。我可以带你出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12763.67, "timestamp": "03:32:43", "text": "从那个距离很容易就能看出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12767.75, "timestamp": "03:32:47", "text": "哇。我不需要靠近你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12772.309, "timestamp": "03:32:52", "text": "所以你抬头就能看到我，但我看不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12775.59, "timestamp": "03:32:55", "text": "你在左边。嗯，你或许"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12776.87, "timestamp": "03:32:56", "text": "看这枚正朝你飞来的导弹"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12778.63, "timestamp": "03:32:58", "text": "你。"}]